{
  "clueSatisfied": "This 0 takes no bulbs, so each ringed square can't hold a bulb.",
  "clueSaturated": "This 3 needs 3 bulbs and has only 3 free neighbors, so each ringed square must hold a bulb.",
  "discount": "A bulb on this square blocks every outlined square that can light the outlined dark square, so it can't hold a bulb.",
  "forcedLight": "The other outlined square can't light the outlined dark square, so only this square can: it must hold a bulb.",
}
`;
